course: dictionary
lesson: 4153
title: Muscle words in context
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Long science words can look scary, but the words around them give clues. «The biggest muscle is the gluteus maximus in your bottom.» The words in your bottom tell you where it is, and biggest tells you it is the largest muscle.
explain: Swap in a simpler word to check your meaning. «The gluteus helps you stand up and climb stairs» still makes sense if you read «the bottom muscle helps you stand up and climb stairs». Medical words often have plain partners like this.
explain: Some words have an everyday short form. Your PE teacher may say «glutes» instead of gluteus, and both mean the same muscles. When context is not enough, a dictionary or your teacher can help.
fact: Gluteus is a noun, and its plural is glutei.
fact: A gluteus is one of the three big muscles in each buttock (bottom).
fact: The three are gluteus maximus, gluteus medius and gluteus minimus; maximus is the biggest.
fact: «Glutes» is an informal, everyday short word for these muscles.
fact: Squats, running and climbing stairs all work your glutes, helping you stand, walk, run and climb.
exercise: «The biggest muscle is the gluteus maximus in your bottom.» Where is the gluteus maximus? | In your ear | In your head | In your arm | *In your bottom
exercise: «The gluteus maximus helps hold you upright and push you up stairs.» What does it help you do? | Bite very hard | Hear loud sounds | *Push yourself up stairs | Chew your food
exercise: Your PE teacher says, «Do three squats to work your glutes.» What are glutes? | Your teeth | Your elbows | Your knees | *The bottom muscles
test: «The gluteus medius is one of three muscles in each bottom cheek.» What does this sentence tell you about the gluteus medius? | It is a loud sound | *It is one of the big muscles in the bottom | It is a bone in the foot | It is a type of food
test: Which word is the informal short form of the gluteus muscles? | globe | *glutes | gluten | gloves
exam: Which of these is the biggest of the three gluteus muscles? | gluteus minimus | *gluteus maximus | gluteus medius
